# --- PIMMS run output files ---------------------------------------------------
# Files written during a simulation run (trajectories, energies, analysis tables,
# restart snapshots, status logs, and the echoed parameter / angle files). These
# are regenerated by every run and must never be tracked. `clean.sh` deletes
# them. NOTE: 'restart.pimms' is matched by exact name so input restart files
# like new_restart.pimms / in.pimms stay tracked. The negations below keep the
# handful of tracked data files / test fixtures that share these names.
*.dat
*.xtc
*.pdb
restart.pimms
log.txt
parameters_used.prm
absolute_energies_of_angles.txt

!pimms/data/look_and_say.dat
!pimms/tests/**/absolute_energies_of_angles.txt
